<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the orientation of the target object.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>If the target object is invalid or does not have an orientation then the function will fail.
